{"parse": {"title": "旧金山小子-03", "pageid": 60892, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A7%E9%87%91%E5%B1%B1%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%90-02\" title=\"旧金山小子-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">旧金山小子-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A7%E9%87%91%E5%B1%B1%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%90-04\" title=\"旧金山小子-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">旧金山小子</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.92.91.E4.BC.9E.E4.BA.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"撑伞人\">撑伞人</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 撑伞人</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The One With an Umbrella</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2060103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiuguanneifangjian\"><img alt=\"jiuguanneifangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png/600px-Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png/900px-Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png/1200px-Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>坏消息，伙计们，安东尼这混球已经背叛了咱们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>他最近都在哪儿混？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>他前几天说有个洛杉矶的亲戚来找他，之后就没影儿了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>得找到这混球，给他“看看牙”，把帮派的消息都撬出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>咱们先上老菲利普那儿打听打听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>祝你们顺利，小伙子们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>但安全起见，我谨建议各位带上点儿防身的家伙，一根棍子，或者一张折叠凳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>是提着武器当街找人，还是把棍子凳子都藏在霍利克的大裤兜里，老兄？我们不是街头混混。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>你说得对，那不妨换个词：维持街区秩序并为无家可归与无处可去之人提供餐食住宿的民间非慈善志愿团体成员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>哈哈哈，唐吉老爹要是听到这话，保准得把你扔外边去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>——回见，伙计！回见，医生！多谢了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"waijiejiedao\"><img alt=\"waijiejiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/600px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/900px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/1200px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在旧金山，情报就像蛛网上的细丝，一根根纺在街头巷尾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“街头艺术家”，滑板小子，还有各式各样的街头小贩……海特街，是这附近的大伙儿赖以为生的基础。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J带着两位伙计，来到熟悉的街道，嗅着味儿，找寻叛徒的踪迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>嗨～有兴趣看看最新款的避雨伞吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>撑开它，躲到底下，雨点就碰不到你一丁半点儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我要一把伞能有什么用呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>咱们店里还扔着十来把伞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>是～吗？但我这儿还有很多好东西！一条吃不完的腌鲑鱼，一块咬不尽的甜莓脆饼，一个比您姥姥的姥姥的姥姥年纪还大的发条玩具……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>还有一块能记录下您青春容颜的不老镜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>旧旧的老东西总是装在跟它们一样老的老人的旧口袋里，您要看看吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>J？你怎么跟街头小贩鬼混到一起了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>街头小贩？怎么能讲这么不礼貌的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>漂亮女士的话从他俩耳边轻飘飘地吹过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你这一肚子肥膘还是那么壮观，老菲利普！怎么，不在海特街待了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>比我的肥膘还厚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>憨厚的胖子拍拍肚皮，跟在大哥身旁，笑着给老街坊打招呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可对方却一脸愠色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>别问我，我的店要转手了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>昨天，哦不，前天，前天我就跟他们签了合同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>谁？这事儿我怎么不知道？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>人家跟我做买卖，还得事事让你知道吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>再说我也不认识他们！我是被逼的！我给布莱克汉报警，但他居然说他没办法！**的，那小子收了多少黑钱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>他是不是忘了自己也是从这条街混上去的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>看来咱们的警长兄弟这些日子不太受欢迎啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我打小就没见过街坊们跟警察有好脸色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>别这么急，老朋友，你何必急着走？合同就是张纸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>一张纸？呵，律师提着公文包来找你的时候，你就知道那张纸有多大威力了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>一群**养的杂种！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>一张嘴，一支笔，掏空你钱包的时候一点不手软。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>当心点，J，他们可能要找上你，前街的多明尼和法拉尔的店都让他们收购了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>收购，呸，那叫明抢！我看接下来要轮到刘医生了，唉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老人这一口唾沫，几乎要吐出他满腹的怨怒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>噢，已经来了，但这事儿我和伙计们已经帮医生摆平了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝克特搭上霍利克山一样宽胖的肩膀，舞起拳头，咧嘴笑着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>祝你们好运，我要去新奥尔良了，J，有个老朋友在那边密西西比河口做神秘学买卖，卖巫毒娃娃、蝙蝠粪……嗨，都是唬人的玩意儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>温妮弗雷德被这个地名所吸引，接入两人的话茬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>新奥尔良！您想去拉法耶特公墓里美美睡一觉吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>停一下，这位女士。从刚才我就想问……我记得我从来没在海特街见过你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>喔？难道在这条街做小买卖，还需要先跟您通告一声吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>不，不不，做买卖是大伙儿的自由，我只是好奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>我得给这小东西找个合适的买主。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个平平无奇的、几乎可以说是“丑陋”的发条玩具，而玩具的主人却露出了一个耐人寻味的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老菲利普：</div><div>瞧瞧那边——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顺着老人的目光，一群骂骂咧咧的流浪之人正被警棍驱赶着逃走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>那边的，别聚堆，走，都走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">流浪汉Ⅰ：</div><div>咱们在这待了好几个月也没见有人赶，怎么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>还要我拿棍子招呼吗，啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海特街的巡警一反常态，驱赶着这些平日里习惯聚堆坐在街边的流浪汉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>他、他们怎么在赶人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>这太坏了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>上头有命令。别让我看见你们在这闲逛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>嘿——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>布鲁诺！是不是哪个倒霉伙计把口香糖吐到你的新皮鞋上了？今天火气这么大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>别来碍我的事，上回你掩护那群涂鸦小子的账我还没跟你算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>上头传话，今天必须让这些家伙从海特街消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>那他们应该上哪去呢？无家可归的孩子，找不到活儿干的流浪汉，伙计，给他们留条活路，这儿离救济院最近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>去哪？爱去哪去哪，旧金山有的是桥洞给他们睡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>你想当英雄？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>先放下棍子，布鲁诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我带他们走，保证这些伙计不在你地盘上闹事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巡警先生那张凶神恶煞的脸稍稍缓和了下来，J的提议让他看到一丝从“作恶”的职责中解脱出来的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>谁也不准在我的地盘闹事。我要他们从这儿消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>布莱克汉那混蛋只跟我说了赶没身份的移民，没说要把街上的小子们全赶走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>我不关心这些，小子，我只知道头儿怎么下命令，我就怎么干。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>店里还能开火做饭，给他们整点吃的不麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>怎么说，头儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>人人都有吃顿饱饭的权利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡警：</div><div>你管得了他们几顿饭？爱逞英雄那就逞吧，但要是明天让我在街上看到他们，J，别怪我来店里找你麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你找我麻烦的时候也不少，伙计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小伙子拍拍巡警伙计的肩膀，随即抽身走向惊散的“羊群”，朝惊慌无措的他们喊话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>如果有人还饿着肚子——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>如果他还想要一张不会淋雨的床铺——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>如果他还愿意听听乔，我，海特街的乔·布朗的声音——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>那就跟上来，跟上我和我的伙计们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“羊群”迟疑片刻，第一个胆大的迈出脚步，跑过马路来到J身旁。越来越多的人也紧随其后，为了J对食物和住处的许诺向他聚拢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>啊，小伙子，您看起来是个不错的羊倌，拿着一根牧杖，带着一大一小两只牧羊犬，领着您的羊群回圈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>斯普特尼克女士，把辣酱拿过来，我给大伙儿做个中式墨西哥牛肉卷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>保准辣得他们喉咙喷火！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-305501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-305501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-305501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯普特尼克：</div><div>J先生，这、这听起来不是很妙啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>霍利克！霍利克，你小子跑哪去了？！下一锅你来替我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-309410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-309410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-309410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>贝克特——贝克特——！快把盘子都端出去，厨房要放不下了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"225\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan2_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan2_zone.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1640\" data-file-height=\"616\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>排好队，各位，排好队，让老人和孩子在前头，保持秩序，不要慌，不要急。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>噢，J，店里好久没这么热闹了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>海特街的移民朋友们最近哪去了？没了他们光顾，生意都不太景气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>让布莱克汉弄进警局里关着了，该死。但他也是接到命令，没办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>给刘医生打个电话，这儿有人生病了，咱们需要他帮帮忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>对了，今天有多少人跟我们回来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>跟着你来的新朋友有二十一位，老朋友有三个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>三个“老”朋友里，包括我吗？这可是温妮弗雷德和你们的初次见面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>嗯？没想到你也跟过来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>喔？这很意外吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>要尊重老人，小伙子们。这儿有可爱的海绵蛋糕吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯普特尼克：</div><div>温、温妮弗雷德女士，我想我们恐怕……恐怕没法提供定制化的饮食，除非您照着菜单额外付钱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>请各位排好队，不要拥挤，不要踩踏，大家一定都能吃上一顿热饭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>J，这么多张嘴我们可没法一直养着，这些天生意不好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当着众人的面，正在分发通心粉的贝克特停下手中的铁勺，面带忧色，凑到J身旁说道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>闲人养不了太久的，J，要不明天就让他们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">流浪汉Ⅰ：</div><div>我们能做事！力气活、干架撑场子、替人蹲号子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>咱们总不能拿唐吉老爹的饭馆当慈善食堂办。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>今天收留他们，J，明天最好还是让他们自己……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我会给他们找出路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>先让大伙儿吃饱饭，至少吃饱今天这顿饭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>唐吉老爹怎么喂饱我们，我们就怎么喂饱他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>行，你是头儿，J，老规矩，我听你的。霍利克，来搭把手，给大伙儿加几块肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>你有一个聪明又狡猾的伙伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>他一贯这样，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挂上打烊牌子后，餐馆里反倒比往常热闹不少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>谁有安东尼的消息？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">流浪汉Ⅱ：</div><div>安东尼？干嘛找他？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你见到那混球了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">流浪汉Ⅱ：</div><div>混球？他确实变成了个到处鬼混的烂皮球……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他擦掉嘴角的辣酱，拍拍肚皮，仰天伸个懒腰，为刚刚填满的胃打了个长长的嗝儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">流浪汉Ⅱ：</div><div>西海岸之星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">流浪汉Ⅱ：</div><div>一连几个晚上我去那讨酒喝，都看见安东尼搂着几个妞儿往里头走。他小子走哪发的财？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯普特尼克：</div><div>啊！我在那儿打过工，但居然没看见过安东尼先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>宝贝儿，发光的迪斯科彩球就是你？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯普特尼克：</div><div>咳，不是不是，您看见的绝对不是我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>西海岸之星，行，我知道那鬼地方在哪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">流浪汉Ⅱ：</div><div>霍利克，还有汽水吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-625601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>吃饱了就来刷碗，臭小子，餐馆里可不养闲人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>让他歇歇，贝克特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金色落日穿过旧金山的红色大桥，斜照进餐馆里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>伙计们，在这儿好好照顾新朋友，别丢了咱们的脸。然后明早十点，到我的工坊碰面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>记住，十点，别让我把你俩从那张臭烘烘的床上拎起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特&amp;霍利克：</div><div>没问题！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>J，你要去哪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>去见见老朋友——我们“亲爱的”安东尼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯普特尼克：</div><div>您要一、一个人去吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>大伙儿留下看家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我自己去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>下手别太狠——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没等老大哥话音落下，J已经迈着大步离开，随即传来摩托引擎咆哮的轰鸣声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而机车骑手已经风驰电掣般消失在旧金山的薄暮中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>他把自己当作了电影主角？好吧，年轻人，一个孤胆英雄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>一个……一个好小伙子。对了，斯普特尼克女士，几点了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-625701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-625701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-625701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>差两分钟七点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-305501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-305501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-305501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯普特尼克：</div><div>您怎么抢我的话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>什么，七点了？！噢！这儿有电视吗？！好啦，节目要开播了——大家坐近点，打开电视，聊聊我们的故事……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "旧金山小子-03"}}